{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 162007, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 108497, "uid": 176744, "type": 4, "title": "萌新指北", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1657703148, "updated_at": 1657719968, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1668344152, "last_at": 1668344152, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "1.日服的主要优势如果说国际服的dc（destinychild）和韩服的dc（据说也快起来了）需要你每天在线，养成一个角色需要花费大量的精力和时间的话，日服可以说是资源虽然获取缓慢，但是相对最为佛系的", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_420/1164/176744/2022/6/13/368469.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_959/1164/176744/2022/6/13/483496.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_934/1164/176744/2022/6/13/358330.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 11715, "is_top": 1, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 162007, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"420\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_420/1164/176744/2022/6/13/368469.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_420/1164/176744/2022/6/13/368469.png\" style=\"height:290.969px;width:729.127px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">1.日服的主要优势</span></span></div></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">如果说<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">国际服的dc</span>（<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">destiny child</span>）和<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">韩服的dc</span>（据说也快起来了）需要你每天在线，养成一个角色需要花费大量的精力和时间的话，日服可以说是资源虽然获取缓慢，但是相对最为佛系的服务器了。（<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">拉满一个角色只需要喂史莱姆，别的服务器要反复刷图</span>）除了rd模式可能想获得大量资源需要挂着刷外，日服每天只需<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">半个小时</span>（甚至更懒只拿大头你只要五分钟）就能愉快下线。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;那么如果你也觉得我是来玩游戏的而不是来每天搬砖的，那么欢迎来日服。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">2.界面</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 那么欢迎你！首先我们来了解一下新界面<div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 713.984px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">主界面</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"580\" data-height=\"959\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_959/1164/176744/2022/6/13/483496.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_959/1164/176744/2022/6/13/483496.png\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">天子列表</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><img data-width=\"570\" data-height=\"934\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_934/1164/176744/2022/6/13/358330.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_570/h_934/1164/176744/2022/6/13/358330.png\" style=\"height:566.932px;width:346px;\"><img data-width=\"578\" data-height=\"953\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_953/1164/176744/2022/6/13/292943.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_578/h_953/1164/176744/2022/6/13/292943.png\" style=\"height:567.453px;width:344.135px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">技能</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"586\" data-height=\"959\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_586/h_959/1164/176744/2022/6/13/690690.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_586/h_959/1164/176744/2022/6/13/690690.png\" style=\"height:533.955px;width:326.266px;\"><img data-width=\"571\" data-height=\"867\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_571/h_867/1164/176744/2022/6/13/131001.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_571/h_867/1164/176744/2022/6/13/131001.png\" style=\"height:535px;width:352.323px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">背包</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"580\" data-height=\"784\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_784/1164/176744/2022/6/13/258721.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_580/h_784/1164/176744/2022/6/13/258721.png\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">成就和日常</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"574\" data-height=\"856\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_856/1164/176744/2022/6/13/229976.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_574/h_856/1164/176744/2022/6/13/229976.png\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">主线和pvp</div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"581\" data-height=\"952\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_581/h_952/1164/176744/2022/6/13/576215.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_581/h_952/1164/176744/2022/6/13/576215.png\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:713.984px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);vertical-align:middle;height:0.8rem;width:calc(100%-2.13333rem);color:rgb(51,51,51);\">夜世界<br style=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"min-height:2.66667rem;background:rgb(248,248,248);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"584\" data-height=\"955\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_584/h_955/1164/176744/2022/6/13/453989.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_584/h_955/1164/176744/2022/6/13/453989.png\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"\">3.投资顺序</span></span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span>知道了dc的大致界面和功能，那么我们该怎么玩这个游戏呢？首先dc的主线剧情极其简单，随便配一套合理的高练度阵容就可以横推过去，这里就不细细提及了。在dc中，钻石资源也就是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">抽卡资源</span>主要产出是pvp（<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">抽更多的卡</span>），而档期活动如raid和wb等主要产出的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">强化材料</span>（<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">变得更强</span>）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;只顾一头是不合理的，但是作为萌新前期的取舍当然是以抽卡资源为主。另外dc这个游戏的活动，只要你足够欧，你在pve中混到的奖励不会比大佬低特别多。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我推荐萌新的资源投资顺序为：<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);\">竞技场--raid斩车---wb5千万</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">（15200分以上一周2700钻石，每日一天250钻石，就这些2周大致一次活动时间就有8900钻石了，乱斗和活动随便混混就1万起步。出一个抽一个简直不要太轻松。）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">第一步：&nbsp;<img data-width=\"132\" data-height=\"95\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_132/h_95/1164/176744/2022/6/13/484723.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_132/h_95/1164/176744/2022/6/13/484723.png\" style=\"height:60px;width:84px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;组成一队高练度的pvp阵容可以<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">每周固定65胜稳定在15200分</span>来获取大量的钻石和少量点火材料。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">第二步：&nbsp;<img data-width=\"146\" data-height=\"150\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_146/h_150/1164/176744/2022/6/13/948312.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_146/h_150/1164/176744/2022/6/13/948312.png\" style=\"height:60px;width:59px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;考虑大力投资可<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">五色斩车的raid阵容</span>或者跟着活动投资<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">对应属性阵容</span>。现在木队和水队（据说）可以实现五色<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">斩车</span>，但不能避免以后策划针对的可能。（具体攻略可以去群问大佬或者等wiki）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">第三步：&nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"134\" data-height=\"167\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_134/h_167/1164/176744/2022/6/13/66059.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_134/h_167/1164/176744/2022/6/13/66059.png\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:48px;height:60px;\"></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;优先投资<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">wb</span>常驻角色达到<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">5千万伤害</span>这一门槛领取附魔奖励<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; text-align: left;\">（具体攻略可以去群问大佬或者等wiki）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">之后的话其实你就已经大致进入财务自由阶段了，想往哪一方面投资都没有问题。萌新最忌讳前期无脑乱抽和在pvp没能毕业的情况下强行跟着大佬冲pve，爽了半个月，坐牢一整年。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">4.每日</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"></span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 那么我们现在知道培养思路后具体应该做什么呢？<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">黑色是重点。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">1.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">每日的丽莎任务</span>：不需要全部做完，可以酌情把有钻石的任务做了。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">2.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">地铁</span>：每日任务领取钻石的一环，前期可以产出狗粮装备用来升级</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">3.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">皮肤塔</span>：也是每日钻石任务，如果奖励不满意或者已经有了，温泉币可以存着等活动给的刷新卷</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.星云：能打多少打多少就行，前期没资源没阵容咱也玩不起人偶。主要是把奖励领了</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5.温泉：领取的温泉币前期主要用来买3星灯笼开温泉图鉴。中后期可以考虑买天子喜欢的礼物送人。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6.探险：塞满后开12小时就行，我喜欢塞满四星角色用来以后进化当狗粮&nbsp; 。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">7<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">活动</span>：尽最大能力去混混就好，勤能补萌。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9.体力：清空体力去刷材料或金币，日服练起来特别快的另一面就是你会很缺材料。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"\">5.抽卡</span></span></div></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 每日勤快的萌新已经轻松搞定了。那么抽卡，我们该如何选择呢？<br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">因为日服每次更新的几天内会有对应up池子，所以歪了这种事完全不需要担心！钻多的例如买了初始号的玩家<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">把图鉴开了</span>（没有的抽一只）后，可以看大佬的分析来考虑要不要多抽几张。钻少的就别想太多了，存着等pvp角色的up池吧。<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">人权角色例外（如鲁邦，蒙眼等）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">红石等打折</span>，红石等打折，</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">红石等打折！</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">红石池子是对应颜色的宇宙池子（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">只要是对应属性就在里面</span>），<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;text-align:left;\">红石等打折抽狗粮用的。</span>总有萌新因为啊我什么角色都没有我去抽红石碰运气吧。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">拜托，我相信来dc的玩家玩过的手游没有十个也有五个了吧。怎么还有因为没有一个强力角色就去宇宙池碰运气的小可爱。</span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">6.装备</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dc的装备除了之前的少数几个氪金装备总体而言都大差不差。重点我认为只有武器需要稍微注意下及格线。<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">1级攻击力534，副属性为370&nbsp;</span>，满级就是1121攻击力。少数武器能更高但要么氪金要么限量。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;拉开差距的主要是对应的附魔。<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">装备每五级开放一个附魔槽</span>，使用附魔材料可以刷出品质不同的效果，右下角是该效果的上限，一般品质越好的附魔上限越高。一套3s的装备打一套没有附魔的装备那就是降维打击。</div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"533\" data-height=\"283\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_533/h_283/1164/176744/2022/6/13/629449.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_533/h_283/1164/176744/2022/6/13/629449.png\" style=\"\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">一开始不需要可以追求高品质附魔</span>，存着材料的弄出来对应的b级附魔即可。等3倍附魔活动开启的时候all in去赌附魔。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">7.温泉</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;温泉随等级开放至四个温泉，每个温泉花金币和钻石可以扩张至8人（建议全开）。泡温泉每12小时收一次温泉币，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">泡温泉不会加好感。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;温泉币可以用来在商店买灯笼和礼物。灯笼必出对应星级温泉皮一个，有几率出高星和多个。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有温泉皮送礼物获得的好感是没有温泉皮的双</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">倍</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">&nbsp;，</span>第一个温泉皮直接开放好感到一定等级，后续每多一个温泉皮增加上限五级。3星满级为80。4星满级90，5星满级100。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每一级好感度会加属性，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">hp-攻击力-防御-敏捷-暴击的顺序挨个加。</span></span>5星角色有喜欢的礼物，送对应礼物可以获得更高的好感度。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">8.活动</span></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 活动分别为RAID和WB和翻牌活动。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">翻牌活动</span>：上对应加成的角色组一队用体力刷活动副本即可，一<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">般每天打最难的8回就够。</span>（最难的仍然是幼儿园水平）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">raid</span>：多加大佬。可以考虑不停发车来混奖励，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">每天把票清空即可。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,80);\">wb</span>：20人组一队打boss，全服进度，先考虑如何全员活着。<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">每天把票清空即可。</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;萌新一开始不需要有太大焦虑，看看大佬们的攻略，以参与为主即可。首要是优先配pvp的队伍来领钻石。dc的活动只要你从头到尾参与了活动奖励不会太差。（欧洲人甚至比大佬拿奖励拿的还多）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);f